==== emphasis ====
<p><em>a</em> <strong>b</strong> <em><strong>c</strong></em> <em>d</em> <strong>e</strong>
foo_bar_ <em>foo<strong>bar</strong>baz</em> <strong>foo*bar</strong>
<em>a <strong>b</strong> c</em> *unclosed and ** loose</p>

-- block
  emph
    text [a]
  text [ ]
  strong
    text [b]
  text [ ]
  emph
    strong
      text [c]
  text [ ]
  emph
    text [d]
  text [ ]
  strong
    text [e]
  softbreak
  text [foo_bar_ ]
  emph
    text [foo]
    strong
      text [bar]
    text [baz]
  text [ ]
  strong
    text [foo*bar]
  softbreak
  emph
    text [a ]
    strong
      text [b]
    text [ c]
  text [ *unclosed and ** loose]
==== code, escapes and references ====
<p><code>a ` b</code> and <code>x</code> and <code>two lines</code> and ```unclosed
*not em* \a <br />
hard<br />
soft © A B &amp;nosuch; �</p>

-- block
  code [a ` b]
  text [ and ]
  code [x]
  text [ and ]
  code [two lines]
  text [ and ```unclosed]
  softbreak
  text [*not em]
  text [* \a ]
  hardbreak
  text [hard]
  hardbreak
  text [soft ]
  text [©]
  text [ ]
  text [A]
  text [ ]
  text [B]
  text [ &nosuch; ]
  text [�]
==== links ====
<p><a href="/u" title="t &amp; &quot;q&quot;">inline</a> <a href="/s" title="q">single</a> <a href="/p" title="r">paren</a> <a href="/a%20b">angle</a> <a href="">empty</a>
<a href="/n">a [nested] b</a> [outer <a href="/i">inner</a>](/o) <a href="/l"><img src="/i.png" alt="img" /></a>
<a href="/r" title="R">Full</a> <a href="/r" title="R">ref</a> <a href="/r" title="R">Ref</a> [missing] <a href="/%C3%A4*?q=a%20b&amp;c">enc</a> *<a href="/u">a*</a></p>

-- block
  link dest=[/u] title=[t & "q"]
    text [inline]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[/s] title=[q]
    text [single]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[/p] title=[r]
    text [paren]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[/a%20b]
    text [angle]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[]
    text [empty]
  softbreak
  link dest=[/n]
    text [a [nested] b]
  text [ [outer ]
  link dest=[/i]
    text [inner]
  text [](/o) ]
  link dest=[/l]
    image dest=[/i.png]
      text [img]
  softbreak
  link dest=[/r] title=[R]
    text [Full]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[/r] title=[R]
    text [ref]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[/r] title=[R]
    text [Ref]
  text [ [missing] ]
  link dest=[/%C3%A4*?q=a%20b&c]
    text [enc]
  text [ *]
  link dest=[/u]
    text [a*]
==== images ====
<p><img src="/p.png" alt="alt emph code &lt;b&gt;" title="T" /> <img src="/e" alt="" /> <img src="/x" alt="a b c" /></p>

-- block
  image dest=[/p.png] title=[T]
    text [alt ]
    emph
      text [emph]
    text [ ]
    code [code]
    text [ ]
    html [<b>]
  text [ ]
  image dest=[/e]
  text [ ]
  image dest=[/x]
    text [a ]
    image dest=[/b]
      text [b]
    text [ c]
==== autolinks ====
<p><a href="http://a.b/c?d=e&amp;f">http://a.b/c?d=e&amp;f</a> <a href="MAILTO:X@Y.Z">MAILTO:X@Y.Z</a> <a href="mailto:me@ex.org">me@ex.org</a> <a href="a+b:c">a+b:c</a> &lt;http://a b&gt; <not auto></p>

-- block
  link dest=[http://a.b/c?d=e&f]
    text [http://a.b/c?d=e&f]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[MAILTO:X@Y.Z]
    text [MAILTO:X@Y.Z]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[mailto:me@ex.org]
    text [me@ex.org]
  text [ ]
  link dest=[a+b:c]
    text [a+b:c]
  text [ <http://a b> ]
  html [<not auto>]
==== unicode ====
<p>a*“foo”*b</p>
<p>* a*</p>
<p><em>—x—</em></p>
<p><a href="/ss">ẞ</a></p>

